      "status": "published",
      "order": 20,
      "meta_title": "About Geeker — Maker electronics in New Zealand",
      "meta_description": "We supply Arduino, Raspberry Pi and components to makers, schools and engineers across NZ.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "about-content",
          "type": "text_block_v1",
          "settings": {
            "align": "left",
            "maxWidth": "800px"
          },
          "data": {
            "content": {
              "en": "<h1>About Geeker</h1><p>Geeker is a New Zealand–focused maker electronics store. We stock Arduino-compatible boards, Raspberry Pi single-board computers, sensors, HATs, prototyping parts and project kits for hobbyists, educators and professionals.</p><p>Whether you are building a home automation project, teaching STEM in the classroom, or prototyping the next IoT product, we aim to get reliable parts to you quickly with clear support.</p>"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
